WEBVTT

00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:42.480
Wh- Who are you?!

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:44.760
I am a darkness
beyond blackest pitch.

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:46.730
Deeper than the deepest night.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.630
That is how you describe me.

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:53.640
I am... the Lord of Nightmares.

00:02:11.490 --> 00:02:15.430
It... It can't be!
The Giga Slave... That spell...

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:19.790
It doesn't just call
upon power from you?!

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:25.160
This can't be... This can't be!

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:28.900
I thought the spell
only drew power from you!

00:02:28.970 --> 00:02:31.200
How can you be here?!

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:56.130
Lord Hellmaster's
spell is breaking...

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:03.240
Yes, it should disappear.
This f alse Sairaag...

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:19.890
My mind is my power.

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:22.830
My power is my mind.

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:26.700
When uncorrupted by other elements,
my mind is my pure power.

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:42.010
I honestly never
expected THIS to happen.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:46.810
After finally having my wishes
so close to being fulfilled...

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:49.650
...to have this sudden reversal
waiting f or me at the end!

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:52.350
My... My plan...

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:54.550
To have this happen to it...

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:58.360
All my calculations... My plan,
with all my perf ectly-set schemes...

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:01.530
So close to its fruition!

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:08.640
So close to its fruition...

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:14.310
I want to be destroyed!
I want to be destroyed...

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:18.080
Destruction? Yes...

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:21.280
Destruction is the ultimate
wish of any Monster.

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:24.150
That's what we were created f or...

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:26.210
Isn't it? Isn't it?!

00:04:26.890 --> 00:04:29.020
That's what we were created f or...

00:04:35.470 --> 00:04:38.600
That's what YOU created us f or!

00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:46.610
But this destruction
shall consume all things!

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:49.240
It shall consume the entire world!

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:57.050
I understand now, Mother!

00:04:57.120 --> 00:05:00.790
That girl is too small a
vessel f or you! Too small!

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:04.450
That's why I have to destroy her!

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:08.130
I'll free you!
I'll set your power free!

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:17.800
All the world! Let the
world be destroyed with me!

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:43.460
Only my mind exists in this place.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:45.970
You, who so desperately
seeks destruction...

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:49.130
...as you wish,
you shall be destroyed!

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:08.090
No...
This isn't what I wanted...

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:46.820
What... What's going on?!

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:49.730
Gourry!

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:51.930
Gourry dear!

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:05.470
Phibrizzo...

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:20.660
Miss Lina?

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:25.330
No. That is not Lina.

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:33.680
I saw all that occurred.

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:39.010
That person is the source
of all chaos. The Golden Lord.

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:41.280
You mean, the Lord?!

00:07:41.550 --> 00:07:43.520
The Lord of Nightmares!

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:45.780
Then Miss Lina cast
the Giga Slave?!

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:56.600
She said it herself.
"My power is my mind..."

00:07:57.570 --> 00:08:02.030
Meaning the Giga Slave is the
Lord of Nightmares herself?!

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:09.340
What about Lina? Where's Lina now?!

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:11.270
That's right! Where's Miss Lina?!

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:28.530
I appeared on this world because
the one called Lina willed me to.

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:36.100
She sacrificed all that she was...
All to save that man's lif e.

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:42.870
The wish that the girl
named Lina sent me...

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:46.080
Her honest thoughts,
her pure heart...

00:08:46.150 --> 00:08:49.090
Because of those thoughts,
I am here now.

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:51.250
She sacrificed
all that she was?

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:54.380
Are you saying that's
what Lina wanted?!

00:08:54.830 --> 00:08:56.820
The polar opposite of
nothingness is existence.

00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:59.190
In other words, when a
pure wish is made by existence...

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:02.360
...to call f orth oblivion,
it must itself return to oblivion.

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:04.630
I suppose that's
to maintain balance.

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:07.400
Then, Miss Lina...
What about Miss Lina?!

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:13.110
The chaos that exists
within me... has consumed her.

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:15.310
Damn it all!

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:20.370
- It can't be true...
- Gourry!

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:24.120
I dunno what's going on here,
but if Lina's disappeared...

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:29.060
...I want it all undone!
I want it undone!

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:33.060
That's right! What's the point of
you saving all of us and Gourry...

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:34.900
...if you aren't here anymore?!

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:37.630
That's right!
That's exactly right!

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:40.830
Lina!!! Wake up! LINA!!!

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.380
LINA!!!

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:20.450
LINA!!!

00:10:21.150 --> 00:10:23.280
Wake up! Lina!

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:26.390
You belong here, with me!

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:29.360
Not inside that pay-off!

00:10:29.430 --> 00:10:31.620
I think he means
"not inside that CHAOS".

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:40.360
LINA!!!

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:45.280
After him, Amelia!

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:46.070
Right!

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:47.540
RAY WING!

00:10:47.610 --> 00:10:49.080
Wait f or me!

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:53.780
No! Don't leave me behind!
No! Please!

00:10:53.850 --> 00:10:55.340
Martina! Martina!

00:10:56.760 --> 00:11:00.210
Now is the time to
pray to Zoamelgustar.

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:17.940
You think I'm just gonna
let you take Lina like this?!

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:24.880
This time I'm going to save you!

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:26.850
I'M GOING TO SAVE YOU!!!

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:40.060
Gourry!

00:11:52.340 --> 00:11:54.180
I won't let you go!

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:00.950
It's no use! Go back!

00:12:15.030 --> 00:12:17.230
LINA-A-A-A!!!

00:12:18.370 --> 00:12:21.000
Maybe you're stubborn
and sort of perverse...

00:12:21.570 --> 00:12:23.840
Maybe you trick
people with your charm...

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:28.480
Maybe you look down on anyone
who's weaker than you, but...

00:12:29.780 --> 00:12:32.270
But I... But I need you!

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:01.840
LINA!!! DON'T LEAVE ME!!!

00:13:26.210 --> 00:13:27.430
Lina...

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:00.610
Gourry...

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:03.040
Lina...

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:02.760
It's over... Everything...

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:08.760
Dear Gourry... Miss Lina...
Miss Martina... Mr. Zangulus...

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:09.900
Everyone...

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:22.120
How could this be?

00:15:34.470 --> 00:15:35.800
Miss Sylphiel?

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:51.080
Miss Lina!

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:52.780
Mr. Gourry!

00:15:57.160 --> 00:15:59.890
Lina! When did you?

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:02.290
What are YOU doing here?! Huh?

00:16:02.930 --> 00:16:04.620
Agh! And what am I doing?!

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:07.730
Why, you...

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:10.000
WHAT DO YOU THINK YOU'RE DOING?!!!

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:15.300
What's the idea, having your way
with me when I'm unconscious?!

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:19.710
An innocent girl's...
I mean, MY body isn't f or that!

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:21.680
Who's an innocent girl?!

00:16:22.150 --> 00:16:23.410
Me, you dope! ME!

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:26.380
But I didn't do anything!
I swear I didn't do anything!

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:27.510
Gimme it back!

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:28.920
Give you WHAT back?!

00:16:28.990 --> 00:16:30.980
I want my innocence!

00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:37.820
It seems the mother
of all things...

00:16:37.900 --> 00:16:40.520
...has a rather
capricious nature.

00:16:56.420 --> 00:17:00.680
Miss Lina, you mean you don't remember
any of what happened in there?!

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:06.390
Yeah... I can remember
casting the Giga Slave...

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:09.590
...and then I lost control of it...

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:16.030
And then bef ore me, I saw darkness
spreading out towards me. Then...

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:19.390
Well, I remember chasing Lina...

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:22.370
...but it's all blank after I
went inside that big black thing.

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:26.440
Well, that's NORMAL
f or you, Mr. Gourry.

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:28.070
Now, look...

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:33.910
I don't remember it very clearly,
but inside there...

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:38.410
I think something
happened in there.

00:17:39.060 --> 00:17:42.220
Something very important...

00:17:44.130 --> 00:17:45.620
So do I.

00:17:51.940 --> 00:17:53.500
I've f ound you, Lina!

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:55.300
MARTINA?!

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:59.010
What's with you? You look
like you've seen a ghost.

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:00.870
A ghost...
You're still alive?!

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:02.980
Of course I am!

00:18:03.050 --> 00:18:07.110
I can't die until I've rebuilt
the kingdom of Xoana!

00:18:07.590 --> 00:18:08.640
Hi!

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:09.710
Zangulus?!

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:12.650
Y- You didn't die, either?!

00:18:13.260 --> 00:18:16.460
Well, let's call it a
blessing from Zoamelgustar.

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:18.550
Exactly!

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:21.460
Viva Zoamelgustar, right?

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:25.170
She didn't die only because she's
the comedy relief in this series...

00:18:25.240 --> 00:18:27.600
I think that's more
than we need to know.

00:18:27.670 --> 00:18:30.800
Anyway, this time WE managed
to beat all of you!

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:33.740
Beat us? Beat us how?

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:40.210
You really should notice your
own f eelings f or once.

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:57.760
Congratulations!

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:10.040
Master Zangulus, you are now
the official king of Xoana!

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:16.020
Uh, right. Right.
Congrats! Congrats!

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:18.280
I'm surprised to see
those two get together.

00:19:18.360 --> 00:19:20.760
Now that my daughter
has a husband...

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:23.290
...l'm finally free of my duties!

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:27.560
Miss Martina looks so happy.

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:30.700
Gee, I wish I was a bride...

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:34.100
I thought you wanted
to be a hero of Justice.

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:38.800
I want to be a hero AND
I want to be a bride!

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:55.720
Oh, boy... Okay, let's go!

00:19:57.160 --> 00:19:59.460
To find you a new sword!

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:00.760
Lina!

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:02.960
No need f or that.

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:10.030
I was basically
taking care of this.

00:20:10.110 --> 00:20:11.010
You what?!

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:13.040
Hey! It's my sword!

00:20:13.110 --> 00:20:14.980
Oh... You had to butt in!

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:17.250
Oh, dear.
Did I do something wrong?

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:20.910
N- Nothing really. Ooh...
Where have you been, anyway?!

00:20:21.690 --> 00:20:24.520
Oh, tying up some loose ends.

00:20:25.520 --> 00:20:27.960
Annoying official duties and such.

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:31.020
Anyway, I'll be going now.

00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:33.090
Huh? Leaving so soon?

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:37.830
Yes, but I've a f eeling it won't be
long bef ore we see each other again.

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:41.440
Huh? Xellos!

00:20:43.910 --> 00:20:46.430
Well... Let's go!

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:48.970
Go? Go where?

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:51.510
How should I know?
I'm only sure of one thing:

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:54.580
I'm never gonna stop and I won't
let anybody get in my way!

00:20:54.650 --> 00:20:56.350
First, though, let's eat.

00:20:56.420 --> 00:20:57.820
Hey, wait f or me!

00:20:57.890 --> 00:20:58.980
I'm coming, too, this time!

00:20:59.060 --> 00:21:01.750
She hasn't changed a bit...
Okay, let's get some f ood!

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:03.560
All right!
